---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for collectSymptoms. Process developer reports, incidents, and issue histories to identify recurring friction. Separate specific observed costs from broad complaints, deduplicate repeated descriptions of one event, and preserve minority workflows that may face severe but infrequent problems. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
